## Architecture: Two-Mode "Slow Brain / Fast Brain"

```
┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                      PolyQuant 2.0                       │
│                                                          │
│  ┌──────────────────┐           ┌──────────────────┐     │
│  │   MAP MAKER      │           │    NAVIGATOR     │     │
│  │  (Slow Brain)    │──────────►│  (Fast Brain)    │     │
│  │  Offline / LLMs  │ Manifests │  Real-Time / <50ms│    │
│  └──────────────────┘           └──────────────────┘     │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

| | Map Maker | Navigator |
|---|---|---|
| **Purpose** | Discover & analyze market constraints | Execute trades in real-time |
| **Speed** | Minutes (LLM calls OK) | <50ms end-to-end |
| **When** | Periodically (e.g. hourly) | Runs 24/7 continuously |
| **LLM Usage** | Heavy (Gemini Flash Thinking) | None (pre-computed) |
| **Command** | `python -m polyquant.main map` | `python -m polyquant.main trade` |

