## Data Flow Summary

```
                          MAP MAKER (Offline)
                          ==================
Polymarket Gamma API → DiscoveryAgent (Gemini) → MarketClusters
                                                       ↓
                                            LogicArchitect (Gemini)
                                                       ↓
                                            ValidatorAgent (Gemini)
                                                       ↓
                                            ConstraintStore → .polyquant/constraints/*.json

                          NAVIGATOR (Real-Time)
                          =====================
ConstraintStore → Load manifests → ExecutionGuard (in-memory, O(1))
                                          ↓
Polymarket WebSocket → PriceCache → ArbitrageDetector (Frank-Wolfe + SCIP)
                                          ↓
                                   Opportunity found?
                                          ↓
                                   PositionSizer (Kelly) → KillSwitch check
                                          ↓
                                   TradeExecutor → CLOB API  [⚠️ NOT YET WIRED]
```

